EMPLOYEE WORK INFORMATION

Employees in the company have different responsibilities depending on their department
and position.

IT EMPLOYEES

IT employees mainly work with software, programming, and technical systems.
A Developer may participate in application development and solve programming problems.

A Backend Developer focuses on server-side systems, backend development,
and database-related tasks.

HR EMPLOYEES

HR employees work with people and employee-related activities.
An HR Specialist may participate in recruitment, employee management,
communication, and maintaining employee information.

FINANCE EMPLOYEES

Finance employees work with accounting and financial information.
An Accountant may be responsible for accounting tasks, financial data,
and managing financial rescords.

DEPARTMENT COLLABORATION

Different departments may need to work together.
For example, HR may provide employee information,
Finance may use employee information for financial records,
and IT may provide technical systems used by other departments.

The departments have different responsibilities,
but they work together to support the company's daily operations.